{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light fades. Shadows move. Something is watching. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear! Little One is a <strong>first-person survival horror</strong> set inside an <strong>orphanage</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a child exploring familiar hallways that seem to breathe and shift, hiding from a presence that feeds on fear and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/b658da0499773bfc660df31961488a81.avif?t=1761926270\" width=423 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>drop an object</strong>, or <strong>keep your torch on too long</strong> and the presence will hear you. <strong>Noise and light expose you</strong>, <strong>making you easier to be seen and heard, while darkness feeds your anxiety</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/d1cf554c1a29b7eceb368c4060b37bf8.poster.avif?t=1761926270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/d1cf554c1a29b7eceb368c4060b37bf8.webm?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/d1cf554c1a29b7eceb368c4060b37bf8.mp4?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/835bb9a656437ef1b40718ba38c21edf.avif?t=1761926270\" width=471 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Slip</strong> <strong>under beds</strong> and <strong>hide into tiny cabinets</strong> to escape.  <strong>Run</strong> if you must, but every step will be <strong>dangerous</strong>. <br>Hide, listen and survive, because you won\u2019t outrun it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/3961ae27da9e7e5d197d368c4a5fb213.poster.avif?t=1761926270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/3961ae27da9e7e5d197d368c4a5fb213.webm?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/3961ae27da9e7e5d197d368c4a5fb213.mp4?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/035a9d1280b8614a286aa40d823040ff.avif?t=1761926270\" width=571 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hugsy isn\u2019t just a toy. <strong>When anxiety rises</strong>, <strong>hold him tight to calm down and clear your senses</strong>. <strong>Anxiety blurs your vision</strong>, your <strong>movements</strong> <strong>grow louder</strong>, and every sound draws danger closer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/c2e38f083a47b92a553fd769af3f4693.poster.avif?t=1761926270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/c2e38f083a47b92a553fd769af3f4693.webm?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/c2e38f083a47b92a553fd769af3f4693.mp4?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/13ad8349ac6de64ad602e9aed0659f61.avif?t=1761926270\" width=615 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The orphanage holds its secrets close. <strong>Search</strong> rooms <strong>for</strong> <strong>drawings</strong>, <strong>notes</strong>, and <strong>solve puzzles.</strong>\u00a0Each clue brings you closer to understanding what hunts you in the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/2f9834a841ea701d05f9a9616b052fe8.poster.avif?t=1761926270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/2f9834a841ea701d05f9a9616b052fe8.webm?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/extras/2f9834a841ea701d05f9a9616b052fe8.mp4?t=1761926270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114900?t=1761926270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114900/7a9c7d7f49842c1daf8eee3df22722925eebee28/page_bg